# Markdown help (0.1.2): from the editor with an edit not saved yet (Ctrl+H) and back (Esc): the text, the cursor and the
# scroll as they were, nothing saved while the help showed, the autosave after; the header's Esc and Ctrl+H close it too.
# From the preview by the options box (a 3 s hold) and back: the same scroll. The help is read only: a tap on an example
# box or link touches no note. It follows the text size (Settings > Text size: Large).
seed big "Big.md" 20
seed note "Packing.md" tasks.md
wait 900
# ---- from the editor, an edit not saved yet
key ctrl-p
type big
key enter
wait 800
expect state page preview
key ctrl-e
wait 800
expect state page editor
key ctrl-end
type  Typed before the help.
expect state dirty 1
# (the textarea scrolls to the cursor with an animation: settled before the mark)
wait 700
mark
key ctrl-h
wait 500
expect state page help
expect state title "Markdown help"
expect text "What you type, then how it looks"
shot 01-help-top
check help
wait 2000
expect state dirty 1
expect file "Big.md" lacks "Typed before the help."
key pgdn
wait 200
shot 02-help-lists
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 200
shot 03-help-links
key end
wait 300
expect span "Ctrl+H: this help"
shot 04-help-keys
key esc
wait 500
expect state page editor
expect same cursor
expect same ed_scroll
# the edit, unsaved under the help, is saved now (the autosave was waiting for the editor)
wait 1900
expect state dirty 0
expect state last_save ok
expect file "Big.md" contains "Typed before the help."
# the header's Esc goes back too; Ctrl+H in the help closes it
key ctrl-h
wait 400
expect state page help
tap "Esc"
wait 500
expect state page editor
key ctrl-h
wait 400
key ctrl-h
wait 400
expect state page editor
# ---- from the preview: the options box (a 3 s hold), Markdown help, back at the same scroll
key ctrl-e
wait 800
expect state page preview
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 300
mark
holdat 0.5 0.5 3300
wait 400
expect state popup menu
expect text "Markdown help"
expect text "Ctrl+H"
shot 05-preview-options
tap "Markdown help"
wait 600
expect state page help
# read only: an example's box and link do nothing to any note (Tab rings the first box: it comes into view)
key tab
wait 300
taptask 0
wait 300
expect state notice "An example: in your notes a tap on it acts"
expect state page help
key tab
key tab
key tab
wait 300
tapspan "Another note"
wait 400
expect state page help
expect file "Another note.md" missing
key esc
wait 800
expect state page preview
expect state note "Big.md"
expect same scroll
# ---- the text size: Large in Settings, the help follows it
key esc
wait 400
key end
key enter
wait 500
expect state page settings
key enter
wait 400
key right
key enter
wait 400
expect state text_size large
key esc
wait 400
key ctrl-p
type packing
key enter
wait 600
mark
key ctrl-h
wait 600
expect state page help
expect same preview_px
shot 06-help-large
